# Swift Package Manager
#
# We recommend committing Package.resolved to ensure sustainable builds.
# See https://developer.apple.com/documentation/swift_packages/managing_package_dependencies for more details.
#
# Xcode automatically adds a .swiftpm directory to your project workspace.
# We recommend ignoring it to avoid merge conflicts and issues with staging and unstaging files.
